/*Visual suggestion: A security flow diagram showing the authentication journey from user entering credentials, through bcrypt hashing, JWT generation, token storage in localStorage, and subsequent API requests with Bearer token in Authorization header*/
/*Visual suggestion: A sequence diagram showing the payment flow between Customer (browser), React app, Express server, MongoDB, and Stripe API, with arrows for each step from cart checkout through payment confirmation*/
/*Visual suggestion: A deployment architecture diagram showing three cloud services (Vercel for frontend, Railway for backend, MongoDB Atlas for database) connected with arrows labeled with HTTPS requests and database connections, including CDN edge nodes distributing the React app*/
/*Visual suggestion: An infographic-style checklist with the 5 takeaways as large numbered items with icons (shield for security, checkmark for validation, UI states symbol, database for Mongoose, credit card for payments), suitable for sharing on social media*/
